
~ start

father: Hey! When are you finally going to get a job?
kid: Dad, relax. I'm still figuring things out.

father: Figuring things out?! You've been figuring things out for months!
kid: I'm looking for work!

father: Looking for work? Where's your CV? Where are your applications? Where's the money?!
kid: I'll start applying today...

father: Today? You've been saying "today" for weeks!
kid: Okay, okay...

father: Listen carefully. You have one week to find a job. Otherwise, you're out of this house!

kid: WHAT?! You're kicking me out?!

father: Yes! This isn't a hotel!

kid: But where am I supposed to go?!

father: I don't know! Maybe somewhere that pays you!

kid: That's actually crazy...

father: What was that?!

kid: Nothing, Dad. I'll get started.

father: Good. And don't come back asking me for money!

kid: Can I at least borrow some money to print my CV?

father: GET OUT!

=> END!
